name: ['Arashin Sovereign', 'Boltwing Marauder', 'Deathbringer Regent', 'Harbinger of the Hunt', 'Necromaster Dragon', "Ojutai's Command", 'Pristine Skywise', 'Scaleguard Sentinels', 'Thunderbreak Regent']
