text: ['As an additional cost to cast this spell, you may reveal a Dragon card from your hand.\\nScaleguard Sentinels enters the battlefield with a +1/+1 counter on it if you revealed a Dragon card or controlled a Dragon as you cast this spell.', 'Choose two —\\n• Return target creature card with mana value 2 or less from your graveyard to the battlefield.\\n• You gain 4 life.\\n• Counter target creature spell.\\n• Draw a card.', "Flying\\nWhen Arashin Sovereign dies, you may put it on the top or bottom of its owner's library.", 'Flying\\nWhen Deathbringer Regent enters the battlefield, if you cast it from your hand and there are five or more other creatures on the battlefield, destroy all other creatures.', 'Flying\\nWhenever Necromaster Dragon deals combat damage to a player, you may pay {2}. If you do, create a 2/2 black Zombie creature token and each opponent mills two cards.', 'Flying\\nWhenever a Dragon you control becomes the target of a spell or ability an opponent controls, Thunderbreak Regent deals 3 damage to that player.', 'Flying\\nWhenever another creature enters the battlefield under your control, target creature gets +2/+0 until end of turn.', 'Flying\\nWhenever you cast a noncreature spell, untap Pristine Skywise. It gains protection from the color of your choice until end of turn.', 'Flying\\n{2}{R}: Harbinger of the Hunt deals 1 damage to each creature without flying.\\n{2}{G}: Harbinger of the Hunt deals 1 damage to each other creature with flying.']
flavor: ["An Atarka dragon's exhale cooks what its inhale consumes.", "Attracting a dragon's attention may be the last mistake you make.", 'Dromoka dragons foster trust among their subjects, while the other clans must spend their time quelling rebellion.', "The elite of Ojutai's brood, the skywise see their enemies as puzzles to be solved.", 'When battling the Kolaghan, consider yourself lucky if lightning strikes the same place only twice.']
